# Reviewed, exact advertising/marketing endpoints; do not widen to parent domains.
# Operational diagnostics (including Firebase logging and Apple Weather analytics)
# are intentionally exempted in adblock_whitelist.list, not rejected here.
# Attribution: AdGuard HostlistsRegistry maintained DNS/mobile ad filters.
# filter_40 includes the Twitter, Reddit and TikTok hosts below:
# https://github.com/AdguardTeam/HostlistsRegistry/blob/main/assets/filter_40.txt
# filter_2 supplies the Twitter pixel host:
# https://github.com/AdguardTeam/HostlistsRegistry/blob/main/assets/filter_2.txt
DOMAIN,static.ads-twitter.com
DOMAIN,ads-api.twitter.com
DOMAIN,events.redditmedia.com
DOMAIN,analytics-sg.tiktok.com
DOMAIN,ads.tiktok.com
DOMAIN,alb.reddit.com

# HaGeZi's maintained Amazon native advertising/tracking feed:
# https://github.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists/blob/main/wildcard/native.amazon-onlydomains.txt
# Upstream license: https://github.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists/blob/main/LICENSE (GPL-3.0).
DOMAIN,mads-eu.amazon.com

# Apple-specific ad endpoints (not Apple auth, iCloud, media, or service parents).
# AdGuard HostlistsRegistry's AWAvenue Ads Rule includes both exact hosts:
# https://github.com/AdguardTeam/HostlistsRegistry/blob/main/assets/filter_53.txt
# Apple documents api-adservices.apple.com as its AdServices attribution API:
# https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AdServices/AAAttribution/attributionToken%28%29
# Apple documents legacy iAd as integrating with Apple Ads campaigns:
# https://developer.apple.com/documentation/iad/deprecated-symbols
# Exact blocks can suppress Apple ad delivery/attribution; never widen these to apple.com.
DOMAIN,api-adservices.apple.com
DOMAIN,iadsdk.apple.com
